  tracks:
  - id: ridgeline
    displayName: Ridge Line
    scene: Course_RidgeLine
    description: 'A ridge trail above the pines: fast dirt, kickers, a cliff drop
      and boost pads that make you pick a line.'
    lengthKm: 0.9
    thumbnail: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5222b1df96e9c420f8a1e511913d3897, type: 3}
    map: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 31a561891b87f488aae29e18b2f12319, type: 3}
    loadingTips:
    - The trail steers with you. Lean into the stick to pick your line.
    - Boost pads sit left, middle or right. Pick your line early.
    - Hold Shift for boost on the ground. In the air, press it on the green.
    - Hold Space to crouch, let go at the lip for more air.
    - R puts you back on the trail.
